      "source_ids": ["nasa-challenger"]
    }
  ],
  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "The economy had more painful months ahead before recovery began. Over the full five years, however, all seven choices gained. Coca-Cola finished first, with international shares also rising strongly. Compare this with the nearby August scenario: just one month changes the starting prices and final values. Neither date was an obvious winning entry point at the time.",
