  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Budget cuts, labor conflict in Poland and cheap airline fares filled the news. Investors also faced high interest rates and an uncertain economy.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Returns accumulated month after month. Different starting prices changed the final amounts, even when the selected companies and much of the history overlapped.",
    "what_faded_away": "A boxing result and a fare war were memorable stories, but neither revealed the eventual order of these investments.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "The length of the recession and the exact size of later gains were unknown. A forecast was a useful opinion, not a promise.",
